   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Spotlight\n\nA soft stage spotlight searches the dark, overshoots, lands on the logo, and the house lights come up. The placeholder lockup is a stand-in: a host swaps in its own logo by editing the .sp-logo element.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.667 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A launch, keynote or event video should open with a theatrical reveal, the logo waiting in the dark until the light finds it.\n- You want a slower, confident reveal with an obvious landing beat around 0.9 s.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The light should be a horizontal lens streak with a cinematic film feel: use anamorphic-flare.\n- The reveal needs energy and an impact hit rather than a search: use orbit-lock.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Wordmark, default \"studio\"\n- beam_color (color): Beam, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- stage_color (color): Stage, default \"#111111\"\n- dim (number, 0-0.6): Dim, default 0.16\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
